> Beyond myself. Beyond every written start and end of the story. Till we rewrite our fate.
> — Iuno
 She is a prodigious and renowned Priestess of [[Septimont]]'s [[Tetragon Temple]], charged with delivering prophecies that shape the lives of its citizens. While both blessed and cursed with the power to foretell the futures of others, her responsibilities are contrasted by her cocky, outspoken and rebellious attitude, embodying an eagerness to defy all of fate's cruelest machinations.

==Official Introduction==
> Iuno is a Priestess well-known in Septimont for being a prodigy.
She is blessed with the infallible ability to see the future by studying how moonlight changes.
> — [https://wutheringwaves.kurogames.com/en/main#resonators Introduction from the Official Website.]

==Trivia== 
===Etymology=== 
* Iuno may be a reference to [[wikipedia:Juno (mythology)|Juno]], the Roman goddess known as the goddess of marriage and the queen of the gods. She was also revered as the patron goddess of Rome and the Roman Empire.